  "ingredients": [
    "2 pounds dried black-eyed peas",
    "12 cups water",
    "8 cubes chicken bouillon",
    "1 pound bacon",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "2 large yellow onions, chopped",
    "1 pound cooked ham, cut into bite-size pieces",
    "salt and black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/m2Vd6-n803ds5CxflL40Cto1PPo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213015_DavesGeorgiaBlackEyedPeas_ddmfs_Shot1_3x4_4215-504595df769c42f4937211171b940ed6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213015/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rinse, pick over, and place peas in a large bowl. Cover with several inches of cool water; let stand 8 hours to overnight. Drain and rinse.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9t5kg382gCpvip8gah0q2bmVhA8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213015_DavesGeorgiaBlackEyedPeas_ddmfs_Shot2_3x4_4216-acd9a976a92943d8b95da86a0c3029f1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213015/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour water into a large saucepan or stockpot. Add bouillon cubes and bring to a boil, stirring occasionally to dissolve bouillon. Stir in peas; reduce heat and bring to a simmer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8Wll3zezRP6w2bAhlwU9rRec_Dw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213015_DavesGeorgiaBlackEyedPeas_ddmfs_Shot3_3x4_4221-fbffb2d3fba643d58eca3c89275aa5ff.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213015/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place bacon in a large, deep skillet and cook over medium-high heat, turning occasionally, until evenly browned, about 10 minutes. Drain bacon slices on a paper towel-lined plate. Crumble bacon and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/quTjAf-qVPpNiqumbJR4YWcBVcU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213015_DavesGeorgiaBlackEyedPeas_ddmfs_Shot4_3x4_4222-b1b6fa601609472ab4902fe5cb65edcd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213015/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in the pan with bacon grease; cook and stir onions until they begin to turn brown at the edges, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/s7Z-ev7u3vRD8Bg9DW2dDMHvH2w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213015_DavesGeorgiaBlackEyedPeas_ddmfs_Shot5_3x4_4224-c05c58422a3d43c9aec0f4ef0afffa7f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213015/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir onions and cooking fat into peas; add crumbled bacon, ham, salt, and pepper to taste. Simmer over low heat for 8 hours, stirring every hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DrjbSnKFdH1mxTF6CehqIDyyy5Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/213015_DavesGeorgiaBlackEyedPeas_ddmfs_Shot6_3x4_4227-466895caa8c847ffa8e1bfdf8116136e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213015/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
